rs/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-09T17:45:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-09T17:45:35Z","body":"It seems like the folding issue was known when the original PR was merged, unsure if the Array and dictionary issues were known https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99966\n\nI could make a fix that allows for searching inside arrays and dictionaries without a restructuring, however without the unfolding it may be a weird UX (though probably better than what currently happens).\n\nAdding a fix to have it unfold might require a restructure, or at least a bigger change since it would require changing what editors are added. Though I might be misreading this function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646434654/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]